==Miscellaneous==
*Added 3 new [[User Rank]] rewards:
**19,400 grants +5 Catamin C's.
**19,500 grants +5 Legend [[Catseye]]s.
**19,600 grants +5 Special Catseyes.
*Li'l Cats have their + level caps raised from +40 to +60.
**Unlocked 5 at a time after completing each stage of [[Li'l Cat's Trial]].
*Added the ability to switch between and/or when selecting filters.
*Increased [[Gamatoto Expedition|Gamatoto]] level cap to 130.
*Added Extra-Dimensional Materials.
*After clearing [[Stories of Legend]], each [[Cat Base]] foundation and decoration can be upgraded by [[Ototo Corps|Ototo]] to reduce damage to Cats from one trait and grant all Cats [[Special Abilities#Resist|Resistance]] to a specified ability, respectively.
**Slow Beam: [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating Enemies]] and Slow.
**Iron Wall: [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark Enemies]] and Waves.
**Thunderbolt: [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel Enemies]] and Freeze.
**Waterblast: [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red Enemies]] and Surge.
**Holy Blast: [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie Enemies]] and Weaken.
**Breakerblast: [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien Enemies]] and Toxic.
**Curseblast: [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic Enemies]] and Curse.

